<rss version="2.0" xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/"><channel><title>救生艇新闻：博客——保护人类</title><link>https://lifeboat.com/blog/</link><description></description><lastBuildDate>Sun, 06 Sep 2026 01:40:34 GMT</lastBuildDate><generator>rfeed v1.1.1</generator><docs>https://github.com/svpino/rfeed/blob/master/README.md</docs><item><title>科学家可能已经证明了一个世纪之久的理论：太空的真空并非真的是空的</title><link>https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/09/scientists-may-have-proved-a-centuryold-theory-that-the-vacuum-of-space-isnt-really-empty</link><description>海森堡说，极端的磁力会使虚无弯曲光线。一颗死去的明星刚刚证明他是对的。 &lt;img src="https://lifeboat.com/blog.images/scientists-may-have-proved-a-centuryold-theory-that-the-vacuum-of-space-isnt-really-empty.jpg" /&gt;由 PolitePaul 服务提供</description><pubDate>Sun, 06 Sep 2026 01:40:31 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/09/scientists-may-have-proved-a-centuryold-theory-that-the-vacuum-of-space-isnt-really-empty</guid></item><item><title>嵌入式铂通道为散装材料带来纳米级自旋热电转换</title><link>https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/09/embedded-platinum-channels-bring-nanoscale-spin-based-thermoelectric-conversion-to-bulk-materials</link><description>NIMS 和东京大学的联合研究小组开发了一种新型复合材料，通过在磁绝缘体粉末表面涂覆金属并进行烧结，使三维纳米界面分布在整个材料中。利用这种结构，该团队成功地观察到了绝缘体中自旋驱动的热电转换，这种现象以前只能在宏观材料中的纳米级薄膜界面上观察到。 &lt;img src="https://lifeboat.com/blog.images/embedded-platinum-channels-bring-nanoscale-spin-based-thermoelectric-conversion-to-bulk-materials2.jpg" /&gt;由 PolitePaul 服务提供</description><pubDate>Sun, 06 Sep 2026 01:25:31 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/09/embedded-platinum-channels-bring-nanoscale-spin-based-thermoelectric-conversion-to-bulk-materials</guid></item><item><title>7亿年前，盐可能帮助地球变成了冰冻世界</title><link>https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/09/salt-may-have-helped-turn-earth-into-a-frozen-world-700-million-years-ago</link><description>地球可能被一种极其普通的东西——盐——推入了全球深度冰冻之中。大约七亿年前，地球进入了被称为“雪球地球”的极端冰川期，当时冰被认为已经遍布地球的大部分或可能整个表面。科学家们早就知道，不断膨胀的冰可能有助于推动这一转变：随着明亮的冰取代较暗的海水，更多的阳光被反射回太空，导致地球进一步冷却，并形成更多的冰。 &lt;img src="https://lifeboat.com/blog.images/salt-may-have-helped-turn-earth-into-a-frozen-world-700-million-years-ago.jpg" /&gt;由 PolitePaul 服务提供</description><pubDate>Sun, 06 Sep 2026 01:10:31 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/09/salt-may-have-helped-turn-earth-into-a-frozen-world-700-million-years-ago</guid></item><item><title>地球内核可能隐藏着一种奇怪的物质状态</title><link>https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/09/earths-inner-core-may-hide-a-strange-state-of-matter</link><description>极端条件下的实验表明，氢化铁可以进入超离子态，使氢能够穿过固体铁晶格。 &lt;img src="https://lifeboat.com/blog.images/earths-inner-core-may-hide-a-strange-state-of-matter2.jpg" /&gt;由 PolitePaul 服务提供</description><pubDate>Sun, 06 Sep 2026 00:55:31 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/09/earths-inner-core-may-hide-a-strange-state-of-matter</guid></item><item><title>前沿：评论*梦幻器官*追溯了这个概念如何从亥姆霍兹的“无意识推理”通过预测编码演变并最终发展到今天的贝叶斯大脑和自由能原理框架</title><link>https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/09/frontiers-the-review-the-phantastic-organ-traces-how-this-concept-evolved-from-helmholtzs-unconscious-inference-through-predictive-coding-and-ultimately-to-today</link><description>这就提出了一个令人着迷的可能性：我们所经历的“现实”可能是大脑对其接收到的信号不断更新的最佳解释。&lt;img src="https://lifeboat.com/blog.images/frontiers7.webp" /&gt;由 PolitePaul 服务提供</description><pubDate>Sun, 06 Sep 2026 00:40:31 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/09/frontiers-the-review-the-phantastic-organ-traces-how-this-concept-evolved-from-helmholtzs-unconscious-inference-through-predictive-coding-and-ultimately-to-today</guid></item><item><title>光揭示了电子晶体的内部运动并可以触发它们的熔化</title><link>https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/09/light-reveals-internal-motion-in-electron-crystals-and-can-trigger-their-melting</link><description>电子是带有负电荷的粒子，通常在材料中移动。然而，在低密度和低温度下，它们之间的电排斥力会压倒它们移动的趋势，促使它们排列成有序的图案，称为维格纳晶体。 &lt;img src="https://lifeboat.com/blog.images/light-reveals-internal-motion-in-electron-crystals-and-can-trigger-their-melting.jpg" /&gt;由 PolitePaul 服务提供</description><pubDate>Sun, 06 Sep 2026 00:25:31 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/09/light-reveals-internal-motion-in-electron-crystals-and-can-trigger-their-melting</guid></item><item><title>太阳的银河之旅和充满超级耀斑的青春如何塑造地球的气候</title><link>https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/09/how-the-suns-galactic-journey-and-superflare-filled-youth-shaped-earths-climate</link><description>在太阳系的中心，太阳影响着绕其运行的每一颗行星。在最近的两项研究中，科学家们揭示了太阳历史上的古代事件如何帮助创造了地球独特的气候并推动了先前无法解释的气候变化。 &lt;img src="https://lifeboat.com/blog.images/how-the-suns-galactic-journey-and-superflare-filled-youth-shaped-earths-climate2.jpg" /&gt;由 PolitePaul 服务提供</description><pubDate>Sun, 06 Sep 2026 00:10:31 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/09/how-the-suns-galactic-journey-and-superflare-filled-youth-shaped-earths-climate</guid></item><item><title>科学家终于解开了钻石熔化 20 年来的谜团</title><link>https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/09/scientists-finally-solve-a-20-year-mystery-about-diamond-melting</link><description>直接测量极端压力下的金刚石熔化解决了长期存在的理论与实验不匹配的问题，并可以改进聚变研究和行星模型。 &lt;img src="https://lifeboat.com/blog.images/scientists-finally-solve-a-20-year-mystery-about-diamond-melting2.jpg" /&gt;由 PolitePaul 服务提供</description><pubDate>Sat, 05 Sep 2026 23:55:31 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/09/scientists-finally-solve-a-20-year-mystery-about-diamond-melting</guid></item><item><title>科学家首次在室温下观察到量子热波</title><link>https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/09/scientists-observe-quantum-heat-waves-at-room-temperature-for-the-first-time</link><description>我们还有物理学领域的另一个值得注意的第一要报告：一种特定类型的&lt;img src="https://lifeboat.com/blog.images/scientists-observe-quantum-heat-waves-at-room-temperature-for-the-first-time.jpg" /&gt;由 PolitePaul 服务提供</description><pubDate>Sat, 05 Sep 2026 23:40:31 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/09/scientists-observe-quantum-heat-waves-at-room-temperature-for-the-first-time</guid></item><item><title>超越大脑的意识</title><link>https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/09/consciousness-beyond-the-brain</link><description>大多数科学家认为意识是由大脑创造的。毕竟，大多数人认为如果大脑被破坏，意识就会消失。但如果这种共识观点是根本错误的呢？与杰出的剑桥科学家鲁珀特·谢尔德雷克一起探讨思想超越大脑的观点，并探讨这一说法的根本含义。&lt;img src="https://lifeboat.com/blog.images/consciousness-beyond-the-brain.webp" /&gt;由 PolitePaul 服务提供</description><pubDate>Sat, 05 Sep 2026 14:13:38 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/09/consciousness-beyond-the-brain</guid></item></channel></rss>